    "body": "Answer from the machine owner (via the user), 2026-11-19, question 4 (G05.1 AI contour control):\n\n> The G05.1 is set per operation. Default for me is G05.1 Q1 R5 in the start of op and then G05.1 Q0 at the end to disable it.\n\nSo for the Fanuc post option:\n- per operation: `G05.1 Q1 R<n>` at the start of each operation (after the tool change / G43, before the first cutting move), `G05.1 Q0` at the end of the operation;\n- the R level is a setting (his default **R5**; the kit question assumed R1), so it is a machine/post property, not a fixed value;\n- off by default (other Fanuc controls may not have the function).\n\nQuestions 1-3 (G73 vs G83, R plane, M29 before G84) are still open.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
