    "body": "Escalated from effort:medium to effort:high under the safety floor. The requested Fanuc smoothing option changes posted G-code.\n\nAt upstream/main 744c0847b, assets/posts/fanuc.cps has no smoothing switch or R-level option. smoothOn() writes a diagnostic comment. smoothOff() writes no Q0 block. The requested behavior is not already implemented.\n\nThe owner confirmed per-operation smoothing with a configurable R level and the option off by default. Answers about M29, the peck cycle, and the R plane remain open.\n\nNo claim, branch, worktree, code change, or test run was made. No held patch exists. Resume with an effort:high worker.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
