    "body": "fix on issue/2603-fanuc-aicc · PR #3280 · pinned by fanuc_aicc_on_brackets_each_operation, fanuc_aicc_level_is_the_option, fanuc_aicc_skips_a_probe_section, fanuc_aicc_level_out_of_range_is_refused_by_name, fanuc_aicc_on_replaces_the_smoothing_not_written_note, fanuc_aicc_options_are_declared_off_and_bounded · merges at the next cut\n\nThe PR adds only the G05.1 option (question 3). It uses `Refs #2603`, so the merge does not close this issue. Questions 1 and 2 (M29 before G84, G73 or G83, the R plane) still wait for the machine owner.\n",
